# 🚀 B2B SaaS Business Proposal: iRewards
**The Smart Table Storefront That Brings Customers Back**  
*Target Market: Independent Cafes, Boutique Retail, & Local Service Merchants in Malaysia & Singapore*  


---

## 📌 Executive Summary
**iRewards** is a multi-tenant B2B SaaS platform that gives every table its own **intelligent mobile storefront** — plus an automated WhatsApp engine that brings customers back. Merchants across Malaysia and Singapore get one system that owns the full dine-in journey: **order, pay, grow the basket, and retain the customer.**

Customers scan a table QR and land in the **iRewards storefront** — a fast mobile web ordering experience with no app download, no signup, and no OTP walls. They browse the menu, build their cart, and pay via local cashless rails (**DuitNow QR**, **TNG**, and **SGQR**). The storefront handles what a short-staffed floor team cannot: **smart upselling** when the basket has room to grow, and **smart downselling** when a lighter or better-fit option keeps the order moving — all inside the iRewards app, on every order.

Rewards are **optional**. Diners who want them join the merchant's club on WhatsApp after checkout. Those who don't simply finish and leave. For members, iRewards closes the loop automatically: bounce-back vouchers, review nudges, and churn win-back messages on autopilot.

Merchants keep their existing POS (StoreHub, Qashier, iCHEF) for counter sales and accounting. **iRewards is the table-facing storefront and retention engine.** Customer data belongs to the merchant. Flat **RM199 / SGD 80 per month**. No transaction commission.

