## 🖥️ 3.5 Merchant Console (Built & Shipping)

The merchant dashboard is the **loyalty and retention control plane** — separate from the diner storefront. Key modules now in the product:

### Points program (Eber-style tabs)
Merchants configure earn, redeem, and tier perks without spreadsheets:

| Tab | Purpose |
|-----|---------|
| **Points** | Earn rate (pts/RM), redemption (sen/pt), and **iRewards Copilot** |
| **Points rule** | Conditional multipliers (member tier, day of week, menu items) |
| **Membership** | Tier matrix — birthday points, point expiry, welcome/renew rewards, validity |

### iRewards Copilot & DeepSeek setup agent
On the **Points** tab, a copilot suggests earn/redeem structure. A dedicated **AI Assistant** page (Manus-style chat, sidebar above Settings) powered by DeepSeek answers setup questions with **live merchant data** — earn formulas, Monday double points, tier math, and redemption caps — matching production behaviour.

*Requires `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY` in `.env.local`; falls back to rule-based FAQ without it.*

### Campaign bots (Message → Audience → Schedule → Confirm)
The **Automation** page uses a Campaign Bot workflow inspired by enterprise loyalty platforms:

1. **Message** — WhatsApp template with placeholders (`{merchant}`, `{favorite}`, `{discount}`)
2. **Audiences** — All members, new, loyal (3+ visits/90d), at-risk (90+ days idle)
3. **Schedule** — On-trigger (review @ 30 min), daily, or weekly; hour/minute; skip-if-sent-within-X-days
4. **Confirm & set live** — Summary cards (channel, reach count, schedule) then **Save draft** or **Confirm & set it live**

Bots shipped: post-payment join, review nudge, churn win-back, birthday perk.

### Member insights (Analytics dashboards)
Segment bar: **New / joined · Frequent · Loyal · Infrequent · At risk** — powered by paid-order visit patterns. Feeds churn win-back audience targeting.

### Diner rewards UX (Bean Rewards–style)
Mobile member portal at `/m/{slug}/table/{id}/rewards`: digital tier card, 3×3 benefits grid, rewards catalogue tickets.

