## 🎨 3. Closing the Operational Loop (Automated Retention)
The software does not stop working after the customer pays. It executes background scripts to secure immediate return visits and local visibility:

* **The 14-Day Next-Visit Bounce-Back Voucher:** The second payment clears, the WhatsApp bot automatically fires a unique next-visit discount voucher (e.g., 20% off their next breakfast combo) straight to their chat thread. Setting a strict 14-day database expiration date creates urgency, turning a one-time walk-in into a highly predictable regular.
* **The Automated 5-Star Google Review Filter:** Exactly 30 minutes after the kitchen completes an order, the system pings the customer on WhatsApp asking for their rating. If they reply "5 Stars", the bot drops the merchant's live Google Maps link to aggressively boost their local search visibility. If they reply with a complaint, the text is kept private for management logs, trapping bad reviews before they hit the internet.
* **Predictive Churn Prevention:** The background system monitors average visit intervals. If a regular member breaks their streak and misses their routine visit window (e.g., hasn't visited in 7 days), the AI engine triggers a context-aware WhatsApp broadcast detailing their favorite drink to bring them back through the door.

